## Why Tasks Cannot Be Parallelized

- `add-artifact-repository-helpers` cannot run before `create-translation-artifacts-migration` because helper method signatures and queries depend on the exact artifact table columns, constraints, and ownership model.
- `extend-provider-run-operation-contract` cannot run before `add-artifact-repository-helpers` because the task may decide that provider-run changes are unnecessary if artifact lifecycle helpers are sufficient.
- Parallelizing these tasks would risk duplicating lifecycle state between `provider_runs` and `translation_artifacts`.

